4.3.2
The local averages
While the simplest trend ﬁltering is the moving average ﬁlter, observations can be averaged by using many different
types of weightings. We are going to present a few of these weighting averages or linear ﬁlters. In the case of the
moving average (MA) deﬁned above, the estimator in Equation (4.3.11) simpliﬁes to
