and it follows that
MSEpˆyt k|tq  V arpˆyt k|tq   ˆyt k  Erˆyt k|ts
2
The conditional variance of yt k does not depend on ˆyt k|t, and therefore, the MMSE of yt k is given by the conditional mean.
